        "specialty": "spy",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Action\" aria-label=\"Special Action\">*</span></p><p><em>Your patron’s name opens doors for you, even in unfamiliar places. By invoking their name or network in the right context, you can expand your influence even further.</em></p><p>When you make a test to interact socially in high society, you can spend 2 focus to add an Opportunity to the result.</p><p>Additionally, when you choose this talent, gain a cultural expertise in High Society.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Action\" aria-label=\"Special Action\">*</span></p><p>Gain High Society expertise. Spend 2 focus to add <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" style=\"color: #98a4f5;\" data-tooltip=\"Opportunity\" aria-label=\"Opportunity\">O</span> to a test to interact in high society.</p>",
